# Git branches (Silvervibe)

- Day-to-day code changes: commit on **`develop`** (or `feature/*` merged into `develop`).
- **`main`** is production / public landing on silvervibe.io — do not push unfinished work there.
- Do not change the silvervibe landing page unless the user explicitly asks to ship a landing update.
- New routes/screens: add on `develop`; do not link them from the public landing until ready. Keep unknown paths redirecting home.
- See `docs/branching.md`.
